---
interface Props {
  rootHref: string;
}

const { rootHref } = Astro.props;
---

    <section class="gw2-device gw2-device--web" data-gw2-web aria-label="Greenways public web interface">
      <header class="gw2-web-header">
        <a class="gw2-web-brand" href={rootHref}><span class="gw2-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><strong>Greenways</strong><small>Publish a world</small></span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Greenways web navigation"><a class="is-active" href="#publish">Publish</a><a href="#worlds">Worlds</a><a href="#workrooms">Workrooms</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav>
        <div><button type="button" data-gw2-command-open>Search <kbd>⌘K</kbd></button><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="Signed-in workspace opened">Open workspace</button><span class="gw2-avatar gw2-avatar--human">CZ<i></i></span></div>
      </header>

      <main class="gw2-web-main">
        <section class="gw2-web-hero" id="publish">
          <div class="gw2-web-hero__copy"><p>Publishing environment · Web edition</p><h1>Make a place<br />for your work.</h1><p>Gather original sources, compose with people and agents, then publish a portable world with the evidence that matters.</p><div><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="New publication workspace created">Start a publication</button><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="Example world opened">See how it works <span>↗</span></button></div><small>No platform lock-in. Your sources, identity and receipts remain portable.</small></div>
          <div class="gw2-web-hero__world" aria-label="Publication world preview"><div class="gw2-world-sky"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="gw2-world-land"><span class="gw2-world-path"></span><span class="gw2-world-building gw2-world-building--one"></span><span class="gw2-world-building gw2-world-building--two"></span><span class="gw2-world-building gw2-world-building--three"></span><span class="gw2-world-tree gw2-world-tree--one"></span><span class="gw2-world-tree gw2-world-tree--two"></span><span class="gw2-world-figure"></span></div><div class="gw2-world-caption"><span>Open distribution</span><strong>A living publication by Chris Zheng</strong><div><span>12 sources</span><span>4 collaborators</span><span>Verified edition</span></div></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="gw2-web-proof"><p>One object through every surface</p><div><article><span>01</span><strong>Collect privately</strong><p>Save original pages, files, conversations and notes into a workroom.</p></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Compose visibly</strong><p>People and agents share buffers, decisions, scoped grants and derived work.</p></article><article><span>03</span><strong>Publish portably</strong><p>The final world retains source relationships, identity and meaningful receipts.</p></article></div></section>

        <section class="gw2-web-worlds" id="worlds"><header><div><p>Recently opened</p><h2>Worlds worth returning to.</h2></div><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="World directory opened">Explore all worlds</button></header><div class="gw2-web-world-grid"><article class="gw2-web-world-card gw2-web-world-card--large"><div class="gw2-web-world-art gw2-web-world-art--garden"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><footer><div><small>ESSAY · LIVING EDITION</small><h3>Open distribution</h3><p>A field guide to portable creative work.</p></div><span>Read ↗</span></footer></article><article class="gw2-web-world-card"><div class="gw2-web-world-art gw2-web-world-art--archive"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><footer><div><small>ARCHIVE · 84 OBJECTS</small><h3>Peacock room</h3><p>Materials, sketches and spatial studies.</p></div><span>Enter ↗</span></footer></article><article class="gw2-web-world-card"><div class="gw2-web-world-art gw2-web-world-art--signal"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><footer><div><small>WORKROOM · PUBLIC WINDOW</small><h3>Release notes</h3><p>Decisions and progress from a live project.</p></div><span>Follow ↗</span></footer></article></div></section>

        <section class="gw2-web-workspace" id="workrooms"><div class="gw2-web-workspace__copy"><p>Signed-in workspace</p><h2>The web shell stays useful without pretending to own your machine.</h2><p>It opens the same rooms, Studio buffers, packages, grants and receipts through remote providers. Native files and protected keys remain behind an explicit desktop or companion boundary.</p><dl><div><dt>Portable state</dt><dd>Buffers, panes, objects and pending work resume anywhere.</dd></div><div><dt>Remote providers</dt><dd>Hestia documents, collaboration and publication remain available.</dd></div><div><dt>Explicit authority</dt><dd>Browser and native effects still require named capabilities.</dd></div></dl><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="Web workspace opened">Open web workspace</button></div><div class="gw2-web-workspace__frame" data-gw2-frame data-inspector-open="true"><header><span class="gw2-mark gw2-mark--small"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>Workspace 01</strong><button type="button" data-gw2-command-open>Search</button><span><i class="gw2-live-dot"></i> Remote</span></header><nav><button class="is-active" type="button">TD <span>Today</span></button><button type="button">WR <span>Workrooms</span></button><button type="button">ST <span>Studio</span></button><button type="button">RC <span>Receipts</span></button></nav><main><div class="gw2-web-buffer-tabs"><span class="is-active">Today</span><span>Release 24</span><span>Distribution</span></div><section><p>What needs you</p><h3>Two decisions before publication.</h3><article><span class="gw2-signal--sky">ST</span><div><strong>Approve package preview</strong><small>Prepared by Mira · 9 min</small></div><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="Preview opened">Review</button></article><article><span class="gw2-signal--coral">KY</span><div><strong>Confirm publisher identity</strong><small>Native signature required later</small></div><button type="button" data-gw2-toast="Identity route opened">Inspect</button></article></section></main><footer><span>Remote providers · Hestia synced</span><span>No native authority</span></footer></div></section>
      </main>

      <footer class="gw2-web-footer"><div><span class="gw2-mark gw2-mark--small"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>Greenways</strong><p>A portable publishing environment for people and their agents.</p></div><nav><a href="#publish">Publish</a><a href="#worlds">Worlds</a><a href="#workrooms">Workrooms</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav><span>© Greenways · Sources remain yours</span></footer>
    </section>
